SUMMARY:Andrew and Carrie: A Night of Comedy\, Violins and Violence
LOCATION:Just the Tonic at The Caves\, 253 Cowgate\, Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:Fresh from hit runs at the Sydney and Adelaide Fringe festivals
 \, this Los Angeles duo and real life couple brings their signature charmin
 g chaos to Edinburgh. Blending virtuosic violin with sharp storytelling and
  world-class stand-up\, it's a genre-bending experience that has captivated
  global audiences. Carrie's plan to put down an aging dog goes wrong. Very 
 wrong. Critics describe it as a rare combination of comedy\, storytelling a
 nd music. This is a must-see for comedy fans\, violin aficionados and dog l
 overs alike.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/andrew-
 and-carrie-a-night-of-comedy-violins-and-violence/
